    {
      "key": "Sandbox_SurvivorsSong_PlaybackDuration_tooltip",
      "en": "Maximum normal-CD playback time measured in game minutes. If the native CD program ends early, it repeats until this limit. Manual Stop always ends playback immediately.",
      "cn": "普通 CD 的最长播放时间，按游戏内分钟计算。原版 CD 内容提前播完时会从头继续，直到达到该时长；手动停止会立即结束。",
      "ch": "普通 CD 的最長播放時間，按遊戲內分鐘計算。原版 CD 內容提前播完時會從頭繼續，直到達到該時長；手動停止會立即結束。",
      "reviewed": true,
      "runtime_group": "workshop/Contents/mods/SurvivorsSong/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/{LOCALE}/Sandbox.json"
    },
