    {
      "key": "Sandbox_SurvivorsSong_ReduceBoredom_tooltip",
      "en": "Reduces Boredom once per game minute while an ordinary CD is audibly playing through powered headphones. Applies to every ordinary CD, including repeats. This switch controls the additional effect; vanilla media rewards remain. Enabled by default.",
      "cn": "通过有电且有声的耳机收听普通 CD 时，每个游戏分钟降低无聊。所有普通 CD（包括重复播放）均生效。此开关控制额外效果，原版媒体奖励保留。默认开启。",
      "ch": "透過有電且有聲的耳機收聽普通 CD 時，每個遊戲分鐘降低無聊。所有普通 CD（包括重複播放）均生效。此開關控制額外效果，原版媒體獎勵保留。預設開啟。",
      "reviewed": true,
      "runtime_group": "workshop/Contents/mods/SurvivorsSong/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/{LOCALE}/Sandbox.json"
    },
