    {
      "key": "Sandbox_SurvivorsSong_RestoreTimeMultiplier_tooltip",
      "en": "Scales recovery time. At 1.0, all recorded knowledge uses Personal Journal workload weights and the vanilla reading-duration calculation.",
      "cn": "调整知识恢复时间。1.0 时，所有已记录知识采用个人日志的工作量权重和原版阅读时长计算。",
      "ch": "調整知識恢復時間。1.0 時，所有已記錄知識採用個人日誌的工作量權重和原版閱讀時長計算。",
      "reviewed": true,
      "runtime_group": "workshop/Contents/mods/SurvivorsSong/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/{LOCALE}/Sandbox.json"
