    {
      "key": "Sandbox_SurvivorsSong_RecoveryPercent_tooltip",
      "en": "Sets how much recorded CD knowledge is recoverable. Skill XP is scaled numerically; recipes, read skill books and qualifying training media are selected by recorded counts, rounded up. Repeated listening never stacks recovery or lowers current progress.",
      "cn": "设置 CD 已记录知识的可恢复比例。技能经验按数值计算；配方、已读技能书和有效培训媒体按各自记录数量向上取整选择。重复收听不会叠加恢复，也不会降低当前进度。",
      "ch": "設定 CD 已記錄知識的可恢復比例。技能經驗按數值計算；配方、已讀技能書和有效培訓媒體按各自記錄數量向上取整選擇。重複收聽不會疊加恢復，也不會降低目前進度。",
      "reviewed": true,
      "runtime_group": "workshop/Contents/mods/SurvivorsSong/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/{LOCALE}/Sandbox.json"
    },
