    {
      "key": "Sandbox_SurvivorsSong_TrainingMedia_tooltip",
      "en": "Controls whether watched training media are recorded on the CD and can be restored. Only CDs and VHS tapes with permanent skill, experience, or recipe rewards are recorded; entertainment-only media are unaffected.",
      "cn": "控制已看培训媒体是否记录并可恢复。只记录带永久技能、经验或配方奖励的 CD/VHS，纯娱乐媒体不受影响。",
      "ch": "控制已看培訓媒體是否記錄並可恢復。只記錄帶永久技能、經驗或配方獎勵的 CD/VHS，純娛樂媒體不受影響。",
